491825497_1415346107248835_3613178418530277774_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sC1VtO3UMWAQ7kNvwHe7cCx&_nc_oc=AdrMdn-91zppYz0EOaFNDFI7VDyhicOj7Y21rLB2EbGKX5hQAHgXicXKHXWtRP6IwlQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSB29n3_nLPUzU4sK89OisX1WvIDHWnYMdPtr2Kc0NDMw&oe=6B0C5391"}, {"file_name": "01_cage_shootout.png", "id": "1490241906381853", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825481_1490241909715186_6989171750510869612_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AleXKKchOlsQ7kNvwHbRqo3&_nc_oc=Adr_Xg_JGwd8nZciks8LwAB0JBkAYjom-nHYn-Bajtq7XCWFWEI15zVz9VLWa6wbNjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTqn6iwf4eZe4w4yw1BIZaim_plDs0W93WcshL8Ex2_Mg&oe=6B0C65D9"}, {"file_name": "04_grenade_path.png", "id": "1069275809468699", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1069275816135365_8245754958877304747_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DGkQZUGORNIQ7kNvwGT5eG-&_nc_oc=Ado-NEX35yKzN4lL9ILrNEDkVZB40HufruFfa7QWODmD5BVYRBVFz2DPBux4wCcMpbc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRXlZnFv2qQSP9uyX80GN0NWla9Y6N2fmCNuKPR0_KNUg&oe=6B0C5961"}, {"file_name": "02_bar_hang.png", "id": "1457426872473829", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_1457426879140495_6994644784184104955_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=agFHNkakCEIQ7kNvwFGmCki&_nc_oc=AdqjPfjBgbT1jT4rs3F7E8jRggTqbjsTCf9-DE0khhlHN9xgrVtZ23kur-elBrFdJfM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQy6rgI58gWqEP2IBLElT4sODarXdI_ALV_vykXZK1oyA&oe=6B0C6E2C"}, {"file_name": "06_jetpack_cage.png", "id": "3623057441201750", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_3623057444535083_274781004489613872_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8SN7mJ5NLdEQ7kNvwHVuIfX&_nc_oc=AdrgshnnSAZEDPgcZUHMfciEjceGEXqxzXFBM7A9lYlbJJ0v9TZX_3tgJSM4EuXUPd0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ9FjcUj6EFcNTLxjI8oegq4y_lJ6DVMMZx-UPtWW-CVQ&oe=6B0C57AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gorilla: I am Monkey", "keywords": ["monkey", "gorilla", "simulator", "zoo", "pet"], "long_description": "Be a monkey in VR. This is a physics sandbox monkey simulator. Climb the cage, swing from the bars, fling yourself through the air like a gorilla, and grab everything you see. Then break out of the zoo.\n\nYou're the newest ape in the zoo, and the visitors came to watch. Give them a show. Feed them bananas, steal their hats, take selfies, throw fruit, or slap them with a fish. Everyone reacts to what you do, including the police. Push too far and the SWAT team turns up.\n\nEle the elephant has a plan for the great zoo escape. Work through 37 missions over four acts, unlock the lockers, grab the jetpack, escape the cage, and free your buddy George.\n\nFeatures\n\nReal VR monkey movement: walk, jump, climb, swing and fling with your hands.\nA physics sandbox with 70 toys and props: bananas, cameras, hats, guns, a flamethrower and a jetpack.\nVisitors and police who react to every prank, punch and gift, with ragdoll physics.\nA story mode with 37 jobs in four acts, ending in the zoo escape.\nAn open zoo with 5 minigames and a climbing gym.\n20 hand skins and 20 accessories to unlock with bananas.\nA reputation system: be the zoo's sweetheart, or its worst nightmare.\nSingle player, played standing or roomscale. Comfort options include snap turn and a vignette.\nLanguages: English, Espa\u00f1ol, Fran\u00e7ais, Deutsch, Portugu\u00eas and Italiano.\nNo ads. No in-app purchases. Just monkey business.", "short_description": "Be a monkey in VR! Climb, swing and smash your way through a crazy zoo simulator. Prank visitors, grab anything, fight the police, and plan the ultima